<title>BELGIUM: EU CLEARS HEWLETT-PACKARD/PHILIPS VENTURE.</title>
<headline>EU CLEARS HEWLETT-PACKARD/PHILIPS VENTURE.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Tuesday it had cleared a global joint venture between U.S. company Hewlett-Packard and Philips of the Netherlands to develop, manufacture and sell components for lighting products.</p>
<p>The Commission said there was no overlap between the two companies' activities in the new venture called JV BV and it had therefore cleared the deal.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
